NOTIFICATION
New Delhi, the 29th December, 2020
F. No. 1-116/Scientific Committee/Notif./2010-FSSAI.—Whereas the draft of the Food Safety and
Standards (Food Products Standards and Food Additives) Amendment Regulations, 2018, were published as required
by the sub-section (1) of section 92 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (34 of 2006), vide notification of the
Government of India, in the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare, Food Safety and Standards Authority of India
number File No. 1-116/Scientific Committee/Notif./2010-FSSAI, dated the 12th December, 2018, in the Gazette of
India, Extraordinary, Part III, Section 4, inviting objections and suggestions from the persons likely to be affected
thereby, before the expiry of the period of thirty days from the date on which the copy of the Official Gazette
containing the said notification were made available to the public;
And whereas copies of the said Gazette were made available to the public on the 24th December, 2018;
And whereas objections and suggestions received from the public in respect of the said draft regulations have
been considered by the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India;
Now, therefore, in exercise of the powers conferred by clause (e) of sub-section (2) of section 92 of the said
Act, the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India hereby makes the following regulations further to amend the
Food Safety and Standards (Food Products Standards and Food Additives) Regulations, 2011, namely:-
